Z||000000||Sillhouette.com||05-07-2000||02:24 AM||||Hello there it's the first time I'm on a board like this and it takes some time to get used to.  Anyways you can view my 87 GT on my home page sillhouette.com.  Currently it's getting a bored out 3.3 with custom pistons roller rockers and crane cam for now.  I already have the Centerforce clutch mated to the 5 speed Monzie.  The car is lowered with cross drilled rotors and KYB all around.  For my next upgrade It'll be the RSM supercharger best bang for the buck.  I had a chance to race the prototype built by RSM at a Corvette event and let me tell you only two Corvettes beat us (heavily modified trailered types).  Thats all about me thanks for Fiero GT girl for showing me this site and taking me away from that boring Stupid other site.    <P>Cheers||||reg||12
