Z||000008||Sillhouette.com||05-07-2000||06:04 PM||||<BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B>Is that RSMs headlight kit?  Do you work for them or what?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yep I'm in close relations with RSM have know them since the invention of the Sabex racing and Fiero shop.  My lates stuff is the sleeper healight kit and the modified prom chip sold with the RSM supercharger kit. Predominatley I detail their cars for shows and races.....<P><BR>Cheers  <P>||||reg||12
